# =====================================================================
# requirements.in — high-level dependency intent for doe-testbed
# benchmark pipeline.
#
# This file declares WHAT we need; `requirements.lock` declares the
# fully resolved, pinned snapshot.  Regenerate the lock file with:
#
#     pip install pip-tools
#     pip-compile --resolver=backtracking --output-file=requirements.lock requirements.in
#
# Or, on a known-good interpreter (Python 3.13.x):
#
#     pip freeze > requirements.lock
#
# =====================================================================

